# A phone held sideways (844×390, DPR 3): the lesson card parked in the
# corner, the tray at the bottom, a lesson placed by touch.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 300 Play
frames 30
save land-title
touch =Learn to Play
until 120 1/5 — Place a parcel
frames 40
save land-learn
touch =Select Twin Column, slot 1
frames 10
touch =Row 1 column 1, empty
until 30 2/5 — Fill lines
frames 10
save land-learn2
